#. Description of the plugin
#: oli-pdf-invoices-packing-slips.php
msgid "Generate and print PDF invoices, packing slips, delivery notes, shipping labels, and credit notes for WooCommerce orders. Customize templates, auto-attach to emails, and manage sequential invoice numbering."
msgstr ""

